{"comment":"A dropped WebSocket: each call in flight fails with connectionLost. The IDE sees that the instance is no longer connected and gives the page a new ticket by airAppHost.connect. The page opens the view again, and the frame gets a resync of the subscription that it holds. The frame never loads again."}
